The test method `PUT_InsertContract` performs an insert operation by calling the `Insert()` method and uses `PexObserve` to log values before and after the operation. The test verifies that the array list's count, indexes of the inserted element, and presence of the element in the list are correctly updated after the insert operation.

Please note that the code provided is specific to the ArrayList class and may require modifications in case you are using a different data structure.

This test method can be applied to other similar methods in your codebase to verify their correctness and achieve coverage measurement by Property-Based testing.

